<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S3 Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S3 Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist reiterated buy rating on S3 Inc, noting continued strong demand for both 2D and 3D graphics accelerator chips.  </p>
<p>-- Notes March quarter bookings are strong, positioning S3 for another possible double digit sequential growth qtr.</p>
<p>-- Raises estimates for Q496 to $0.27/shr from $0.25/shr and raises fiscal 1996 estimates to $0.93/shr from $0.91/shr.</p>
</text>
